<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cloud, mass of clouds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.275
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικροῦ νέφους ἐκπνεύσας μέγας χειμών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1148
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ὄμβριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					288
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. καὶ ὁμίχλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					49c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κίνδυνον παρελθεῖν ὥσπερ ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.188
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου δὲ μέλαν ν. ἀμφεκάλυψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.350
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.180
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθας ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.45
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκότου ν.,</span> of blindness,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1314
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. οἰμωγῆς, στεναγμῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				107
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				1140
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφρύων ν.</span>
			<i>a cloud upon</i> the brow, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				172
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ μετώπου οἷον ν. ἐπανεστηκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					809b22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκεδᾶτε τὸ προσὸν νῦν ν. ἐπὶ τοῦ
					προσώπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			also, <i>a cloud of men,</i> etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν.
				πεζῶν, Τρώων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.274
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.66
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαρῶν, κολοιῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				17.755
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τοσοῦτον ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.109
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενεστάων ν.</span> Timo <i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					12.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμοιο ν.</span>
			<i>the cloud</i> of battle, <i>thick</i> of the fight, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.243
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1090
			</span></i>: applied by <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.9
			</span></i> to a single hero: used by Prose writers for poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλη</span> (q. v.). (Cf. Skt.
				<i>nábhas</i> 'fog', 'cloud', Slav. <i>nebo</i>
			'heaven', Lat. <i>nebula.</i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
